<contentList date="26/10/2020 01:10">
  <content contentuid="he2544cbfgd0c6g4f52g8d1egf3dde2de6d93" version="1">Dermolisi</content>
  <content contentuid="hebec1d8aga526g41fegb08cgc7f243ad0344" version="1">L'acido corrode l'armatura. La &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;Classe Armatura&lt;/LSTag&gt; è ridotta di &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="hd897ff08g5bc5g425cg8cafg6f2dc814f1a3" version="1">Frustata Caustica</content>
  <content contentuid="h12735b96gb271g4d6egbd1egd5844013a477" version="1">Colpisci con uno pseudopodo per &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;, infliggendo inoltre &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;. Un nemico già ricoperto di &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;acido&lt;/LSTag&gt; subisce &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;aggiuntivi&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="hb19a22e1g91beg4f02gbd11g1a9dc833d6e6" version="1">Sputo Caustico</content>
  <content contentuid="h4440d39dg5452g4c7cgb2e7g43840ad73bd6" version="1">Sputa acido per &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;, creando una superficie di &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;Acido&lt;/LSTag&gt;. Un nemico già ricoperto ne subisce &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;aggiuntivi&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="ha6221dacgba37g473ag8407g8f948781fb95" version="1">Progenie Mutacida</content>
  <content contentuid="h47b87f5cg934bg47d1g80d2g4f4a7b8b4600" version="1">Amoeba caustica</content>
  <content contentuid="h7e0c87d0g661eg4668gac42g2e121dab8ae4" version="1">Limax loricatus</content>
  <content contentuid="hae3ee8b0gc79dg4fbega29dga8c66aa34e1e" version="1">Testudo acidi</content>
  <content contentuid="h02501511g97d7g45bcgb830gc101909b540e" version="1">Maxilla vorax</content>
  <content contentuid="h1320fa6dg484bg4b09g82bcg14a1887482b1" version="1">Acidodens rex</content>
  <content contentuid="h2bfea72egc3f9g4394ga18dg3be1d0321094" version="1">Cursor mucosus</content>
  <content contentuid="h4b630834gd8ffg4e2fg8238g608f77e4c9bf" version="1">Velocilimax</content>
  <content contentuid="h5fa4611bg5448g4528g83a1g04b5556cabbd" version="1">Chimaera limacis</content>
  <content contentuid="h105f726eg9bc6g423dg851fgbc1458ea9a15" version="1">Protoplasma varians</content>
  <content contentuid="h2b7fcfb4g683cg4662g9d69g9d3c6304a025" version="1">Sputator caustica</content>
  <content contentuid="h2aa14bb3gd0b2g4efbg83b5gb8680cdbd42f" version="1">Ballista mucosa</content>
  <content contentuid="hb42d0cd0g555dg491aga5a7g5c9c96a509e2" version="1">Covata Acida</content>
  <content contentuid="h04179020g6951g43a6g86f1ge268f4fd7df7" version="1">La prima volta che ricopri un nemico di &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;Acido&lt;/LSTag&gt; in ogni combattimento, evochi una &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; che combatte in autonomia. Cresce e ottiene mutazioni mentre combatti nell'acido — immergendoti nelle superfici di &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;Acido&lt;/LSTag&gt; e uccidendo i nemici ricoperti d'acido. La covata si dissolve al termine del combattimento.</content>
  <content contentuid="he0c0fb16gd671g44edga410g23de5975a0f5" version="1">Vettori di Decadimento</content>
  <content contentuid="haa73f210g2ec5g494fg8fdag3d8c63054150" version="1">I nemici colpiti dalla tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; perdono &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; di &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;CA&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="hf8e38740g977bg47d6g9c87g2c03fc34eccc" version="1">Eredità Solvente</content>
  <content contentuid="h5c324e35g630fg4859g9830g26f89074f0f6" version="1">La tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; ignora la &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistance"&gt;Resistenza&lt;/LSTag&gt; a&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;. I nemici che colpisce diventano &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;Vulnerabili&lt;/LSTag&gt; a&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="hdacb2b73g8076g4168ga43eg9f1b536e298b" version="1">Confluenza Simbiotica</content>
  <content contentuid="ha70e1688ga4b8g4c0fgaaa9gbf20538112a1" version="1">Mentre sei ricoperto di &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;Acido&lt;/LSTag&gt;, la tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; infligge anche &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; e ottiene &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; ogni turno.</content>
  <content contentuid="h08a49ac7g874ag45b1g812fgfbe741741a6e" version="1">Cultura Primordiale</content>
  <content contentuid="hf94c4abcg1cacg4a73ga750ga8b562c4ed93" version="1">La tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; recupera &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; all'inizio del suo turno mentre si trova nell'&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;acido&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="h6434d003g92d3g42ffgb217g6420a8c36bd3" version="1">Mutagenesi Diretta</content>
  <content contentuid="h60f9beebgd6bfg4199g8a2ag0eb027c71503" version="1">Scegli tu le mutazioni che la tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; ottiene. Assume forme più potenti mentre combatti nell'&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;acido&lt;/LSTag&gt; — immergendoti in esso e uccidendo i nemici ricoperti d'acido.</content>
  <content contentuid="h24171af1g3cfcg4e91gae95gf4c3db8e1821" version="1">Spine Caustiche</content>
  <content contentuid="h06d97f6ag6b83g4dc5g9a24g70e918cd5ad0" version="1">Gli aggressori che colpiscono in mischia la tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; subiscono &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="he6e63bd2g1a59g42e4g89b3gc27fa0f3967b" version="1">Guscio Corazzato</content>
  <content contentuid="h32dce215g47a9g4a66gab39g4484244696b0" version="1">La tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; ottiene &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; alla &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;CA&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="haed69e0bg8b8bg4544g92f7g069ba3ed59f1" version="1">Hypertrophia</content>
  <content contentuid="ha128c563g15ccg44edg8a59g3cfe649df93f" version="1">La tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; ottiene &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;Punti Ferita&lt;/LSTag&gt; massimi.</content>
  <content contentuid="h3d3595deg9335g43e9gadc0ga4dbdaf1a3df" version="1">Pseudopodia</content>
  <content contentuid="hce775732g8b2fg4146gbe91gc5bb4db2d076" version="1">La tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; ottiene &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; di &lt;LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;Velocità di Movimento&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="hc7621a23g7c8fg4fe3gb1c7g40fcec66cce9" version="1">Hyperphagia</content>
  <content contentuid="h90485cf1ge091g4e90gbd06gb78510e49e34" version="1">Gli attacchi della tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; infliggono &lt;b&gt;anche&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="h6d1d70d9gf8c2g4bdegb643gc06ce869d38d" version="1">Cutis Mucosa</content>
  <content contentuid="h5022ef91gc5e5g403fg9d33gdd8c4610ba35" version="1">La tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; subisce &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; danni in meno da ogni fonte.</content>
  <content contentuid="h6e690424g97a4g4077gb480g8868eafeeedc" version="1">Acuitas</content>
  <content contentuid="h014da6dcgdaa5g4566gbcdegc3d50ec5b967" version="1">La tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt; ottiene &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; ai &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;Tiri per colpire&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="he658aeb0g6e31g4c4dgba99gb1ee8cd77e3f" version="1">Mandibulae</content>
  <content contentuid="h44d03aabg62c1g476fgaa22g1970f5bdcc83" version="1">Riduce di &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; la soglia di &lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;Colpo Critico&lt;/LSTag&gt; della tua &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Progenie Acida&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="hc376c2a8g305bg4c50ga492gb0dc7f07e9fb" version="1">Presa Caustica</content>
  <content contentuid="he6491ce7g0fc6g4700ga3fbgf77b7a644067" version="1">I colpi di questa melma corrodono l'armatura, abbassando la &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;CA&lt;/LSTag&gt; dei nemici colpiti.</content>
  <content contentuid="h55c413fagcc59g4343gae75g90e3cb8484ea" version="1">Solvente</content>
  <content contentuid="hf9bf73b5gcf1ag4cc0gb6c5g2cc68725f212" version="1">L'acido di questa melma ignora la &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistance"&gt;Resistenza&lt;/LSTag&gt; a&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; e rende &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;Vulnerabili&lt;/LSTag&gt; i nemici colpiti.</content>
  <content contentuid="h72c18e5bg26eeg4231g9d00gac3ccb533ac8" version="1">Simbiosi</content>
  <content contentuid="h37ad109eg31b2g4833gabf1g5ff7bb8482cb" version="1">Impregnata del tuo &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;acido&lt;/LSTag&gt;, questa melma infligge &lt;b&gt;anche&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; ed è avvolta in uno scudo caustico.</content>
  <content contentuid="haa6620eag0a59g4e9cg92c5g32139c5a3d44" version="1">Sazio</content>
  <content contentuid="hba417956g2594g4bdbg9390g035ff4965086" version="1">Questa melma si cura mentre si rotola nell'&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;acido&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="h8a9c0f1bgf0d4g4fe4gbbdegff4194976f77" version="1">Liquefazione</content>
  <content contentuid="h829e5276g272cg4a4eg9cb1g79d7bacbde4c" version="1">Carne resa molle. &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;Vulnerabile&lt;/LSTag&gt; a&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
</contentList>
